  "notes": "Deep Fishing is a casting game from LazyGames. that launched on Roblox in July 2026. You hold and release to throw your line, and the farther it lands, the deeper and rarer the water you reach. One cast can hook several fish at once, which you sell for cash. That cash goes into Strength upgrades so you can throw even farther and unlock new areas like Frostmere.\n\nCodes give Meadow Bait, Tide Bait, cash and Luck Potions. The update codes are the best value because Tide Bait and a Luck Potion together raise your odds of pulling a rare fish. A new code has come with almost every numbered update, and extra ones show up for new features such as skins, keys and the kraken, all posted in the game's Discord.",
